rs","begin":[181,1],"end":[183,2]},"visibility":"public","docs":"Loads a `v128` vector from the given heap address.\n\nThis intrinsic will emit a load with an alignment of 1. While this is\nprovided for completeness it is not strictly necessary, you can also load\nthe pointer directly:\n\n```rust,ignore\nlet a: &v128 = ...;\nlet value = unsafe { v128_load(a) };\n// .. is the same as ..\nlet value = *a;\n```\n\nThe alignment of the load can be configured by doing a manual load without\nthis intrinsic.\n\n# Unsafety\n\nThis intrinsic is unsafe because it takes a raw pointer as an argument, and\nthe pointer must be valid to load 16 bytes from. Note that there is no\nalignment requirement on this pointer since this intrinsic performs a\n1-aligned load.","links":{},"attrs":[{"other":"#[<cfg_attr>(test, assert_instr(v128.load))]"},{"other":"#[doc(alias(\"v128.load\"))]"},{"other":"#[attr = Stability {stability: Stability {level: Stable {since: Version(RustcVersion {major: 1,\nminor: 54, patch: 0})}, feature: \"wasm_simd\"}}]"},{"target_feature":{"enable":["simd128"]}},{"other":"#[attr = Inline(Hint)]"}],"deprecation":null,"inner":{"function":{"sig":{"inputs":[["m",{"raw_pointer":{"is_mutable":false,"type":{"resolved_path":{"path":"v128","id":9346,"args":null}}}}]],"output":{"resolved_path":{"path":"v128","id":9346,"args":null}},"is_c_variadic":false},"generics":{"params":[],"where_predicates":[]},"header":{"is_const":false,"is_unsafe":true,"is_async":false,"abi":"Rust"},"has_body":true}}},"3912":{"id":3912,"crate_id":0,"name":"Output","span":{"filename":"library\\core\\src\\num\\saturating.rs","begin":[551,1],"end":[551,73]},"visibility":"default","docs":null,"links":{},"attrs":[],"deprecation":null,"inner":{"assoc_type":{"generics":{"params":[],"where_predicates":[]},"bounds":[],"type":{"resolved_path":{"path":"Saturating","id":1953,"args":{"angle_bracketed":{"args":[{"type":{"primitive":"i64"}}],"constraints":[]}}}}}}},"25710":{"id":25710,"crate_id":0,"name":null,"span"